+      "scope_note": "Raw Internet Archive capture made 8 November 2021 of the DA statement \"Issued by Helen Zille – DA Federal Council Chairperson 24 Oct 2019\" (the capture also carries a later site banner). The Chairperson of the Federal Council and the Federal Chairperson are other offices and are not researched here. Served without content encoding.",
+      "snapshot": {
