+          "uncertainty": "A resignation claim: it names the weekday on which the Federal Executive was informed of a decision to resign, not the day the office became vacant, so it is never an end by itself; under Ridge's ruling its \"The FedEx was convened on Thursday morning\" fixes the week in which the vacancy statement of 25 October 2019 resolves \"on Wednesday\" to 23 October 2019. The Federal Chairperson is another office. Never a holder date, start or end."
