+          "id": "za_da_federal_leader_position_vacant_20191025",
+          "text": "The statement issued on \"25 Oct 2019\" says \"The Federal Leader and Federal Chairperson positions became vacant on Wednesday following the personal decision of Mmusi Maimane and Athol Trollip to resign from their positions\".",
+          "attested_on": "2019-10-25",
+          "locator": {
+            "section": "Second paragraph"
+          },
+          "uncertainty": "Gives the end of the holder observation of 4 October 2019 (Mmusi Maimane) on 23 October 2019 (Ridge's ruling): a relative day in a dated party statement resolves from its dateline (the CLAUDE-C01-29 rule); this statement is dated 25 October 2019, a Friday, so \"on Wednesday\" is 23 October 2019, the week fixed by the statement of Thursday 24 October 2019 (\"The FedEx was convened on Thursday morning\"). The statement's own date is never a holder date, start or end; the Federal Chairperson is another office."
